      "review_description": "Oasis came in the middle of the three quotes I received, and they had good references for previous similar works in my area. Oh, and they have been in business since the 90’s. (So definitely not a fly by night company) Once the job was complete, the quality of the install was obvious. Another sparkie mate couldn’t fault any of their work, and all they promised with the system and batteries has worked. I haven’t had a power bill in 2 years. Jake and Mikayla are brilliant to deal with, and have checked in to see I’m still happy a year after the install. There’s so many dodgy Solar mobs, but Oasis aren’t one of them. Five stars from a very satisfied customer. ??????????",
