      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Quoting process with Mikaela was top notch. She responded promptly and wasn't shy to have a phone call and hear out all my queries. We went back and forth a couple of times for different proposals and they sent out their electrician, Billy, to check out our place.Billy knew exactly what was going on. I had another 3 installers shy away from in-wall installation of conduit because it was \"a bit more work and too hard\". Being an electrician myself, this instantly turned me away from the other installers but Billy was no-nonsense with his \"I wouldn't want external conduit on my house either\" attitude.All in all, they were flexible with me providing my own inverter for the install (brand new through my own trade account) and the install was neat and fully functional. Sign offs and documentation were concise and the team at Oasis were respectful of our time and my wife and 4 kids on the day of install.Great work guys, can't recommend you more if I tried. Will be putting your name out to mates who need solar/AC in the future.",
